 ```
 
-Sessions never expire.
+Sessions expire after `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds). `save_session` records an `issued_at`
+timestamp; `load_session` rejects older sessions with `SessionExpiredError`, and calls
+`purge_expired()` to delete expired entries from the on-disk cache.
+
+The resume blob is base64-encoded JSON (pickle is no longer used, since unpickling client data
+is unsafe). The blob must contain a numeric `issued_at`.
